{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter"},"abstract":[{"text":"A set of conditions an entity must meet, beyond holding the components a query reads.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"QueryFilter","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A filter can require component types, exclude them, require components added or changed since","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a tick, and require a relation to a target. Filters read nothing: an entity’s components decide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it passes, but a query’s rows carry only the values of its terms.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a filter from a static method such as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/with(_:)-swift.type.method","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and refine it with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the instance methods of the same names. Each method returns a new filter that an entity passes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only if it meets every condition. To pass entities that meet at least one of several filters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/anyOf(_:)-swift.type.method","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", so you can write any condition on which component types an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity holds:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"drifter\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"ghost\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rock\"))","","let moving = QueryFilter.with(Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self)","let movingOrFrozen = QueryFilter.anyOf(.with(Velocity.self), .with(Frozen.self))","","let movingNames = world.query(Name.self).filtered(by: moving).map { $0.1.value }","print(movingNames)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"drifter\"]\"","","let movingOrFrozenNames = world.query(Name.self).filtered(by: movingOrFrozen).map { $0.1.value }","print(movingOrFrozenNames)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"drifter\", \"statue\", \"ghost\"]\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass a filter to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/init(filter:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/filtered(by:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", or as the ","type":"text"},{"code":"where","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"argument of ","type":"text"},{"code":"update(_:reading:where:body:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Queries, views and updates also offer the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"methods directly, so you can write ","type":"text"},{"code":"Query(Name.self).without(Frozen.self)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/init()"],"generated":true},{"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/docu